69165623, 0.027888420037925243, 0.029195458977483213, 0.027475532959215343, 0.027772722067311406, 0.028727701981551945, 0.02949574403464794, 0.028503112960606813, 0.02817764296196401, 0.028375947033055127, 0.03161280998028815, 0.030976976035162807]], "latencies": [1.9907502189744264, 14.76460144505836, 3.2634726469404995, 3.5111308929044753, 1.781019454007037, 11.382508698035963, 0.22329367592465132, 0.5496351099573076, 1.3634717389941216, 5.925228567910381, 1.4970377560239285, 6.800089131924324, 0.7950668879784644, 4.7961463540559635, 0.2671202289639041, 2.7939551339950413], "start_times": [786875.636973499, 786875.63709446, 786875.638362428, 786875.638455186, 786877.627814243, 786878.901939254, 786879.149650234, 786879.373210676, 786879.409148758, 786879.923130435, 786880.77294077, 786882.27040069, 786885.848553719, 786886.643816836, 786889.070811024, 786889.338276442], "queue_times": [0.00014530192129313946, 0.0002526479074731469, 0.0015146291116252542, 0.001603619079105556, 1.9909568839939311, 3.2650778740644455, 3.5127856970066205, 3.7363428339594975, 3.7722775579895824, 4.286255870014429, 5.13606301008258, 6.633519403054379, 10.211669011972845, 11.00692891899962, 13.433920212090015, 13.701382418978028], "generated_texts": ["Yes\u2014*Traction", "Below is a **complete, minimal, and ready\u2011to\u2011run** Rust application that\n\n1. Reads the current clipboard text (Windows, macOS, Linux).\n2. Sends that text to the ElevenLabs Text\u2011to\u2011Speech API.\n3. Streams the returned MP3/OGG audio straight to your speakers.\n\n> **TL;DR**  \n> ```bash\n> cargo new elevenlabs_clipboard_tts\n> cd elevenlabs_clipboard_tts\n> # copy the Cargo.toml and src/main.rs below\n> export ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=\"YOUR_API_KEY\"\n> cargo run\n> ```\n\n---\n\n## 1. Prerequisites\n\n| Item | How to get it |\n|------|---------------|\n| **ElevenLabs API key** | Sign up at <https://elevenlabs.io> \u2192 *API* \u2192 *API Key* |\n| **Voice ID** | In the ElevenLabs dashboard \u2192 *Voice Library* \u2192 click a voice \u2192 copy the `voice_id` |\n| **Rust toolchain** | <https://rustup.rs> (install `rustup`, then `rustup default stable`) |\n| **Audio output** | Any working audio device (the app uses the default output device). |\n\n> **Tip** \u2013 Store the API key in an environment variable so it never ends up in source control.\n\n```bash\n# macOS / Linux\nexport ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=\"sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\"\n\n# Windows PowerShell\n$env:ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=\"sk-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Project Layout\n\n```\nelevenlabs_clipboard_tts/\n\u251c\u2500 Cargo.toml\n\u2514\u2500 src/\n   \u2514\u2500 main.rs\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Cargo.toml\n\n```toml\n[package]\nname = \"elevenlabs_clipboard_tts\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nedition = \"2021\"\n\n# Optional: enable the `clipboard` feature on Windows for better performance\n[features]\ndefault = [\"clipboard\"]\n\n[dependencies]\ntokio = { version = \"1\", features = [\"full\"] }\nreqwest = { version = \"0.12\", features = [\"json\", \"stream\"] }\n", "Sure thing! To make the \u201cFilters\u201d section clearer and easier to read, I\u2019ll need the current version of the document (or at least the part that contains the Filters). Once I have that, I can rewrite it in a more", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "## LCD\u2011Control System with a Potentiometer and a Temperature Sensor  \n*(Arduino\u2011based, using an LCD\u202fI\u00b2C backpack and either an LM35 or a DS18B20)*  \n\nBelow is a complete, step\u2011by\u2011step guide that covers:\n\n| Item | What it does | Typical pin\u2011out |\n|------|--------------|-----------------|\n| **Arduino** | MCU that reads the sensor, reads the potentiometer, drives the LCD | \u2013 |\n| **LM35** | Analog temperature sensor (10\u202fmV/\u00b0C) | VCC \u2192 5\u202fV, GND \u2192 GND, Vout \u2192 A0 |\n| **DS18B20** | Digital 1\u2011Wire temperature sensor | VCC \u2192 5\u202fV, GND \u2192 GND, DQ \u2192 D2 (with 4.7\u202fk\u03a9 pull\u2011up) |\n| **LCD\u202fI\u00b2C** | 16\u00d72 character display with I\u00b2C backpack | SDA \u2192 A4, SCL \u2192 A5 (on Uno) |\n| **Potentiometer (10\u202fk\u03a9)** | Adjusts a value", "", "### Quick answer\n\n```js\n", "", ""], "errors": ["", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], "max_output_tokens_per_s": 108.0, "max_concurrent_requests": 8, "rtfx": 0.0, "spec_decode_acceptance_rate": 21.594457455113194, "spec_decode_acceptance_length": 2.5116120218579234, "spec_decode_num_drafts": 1464, "spec_decode_draft_tokens": 10248, "spec_decode_accepted_tokens": 2213, "spec_decode_per_position_acceptance_rates": [0.6659836065573771, 0.37363387978142076, 0.2062841530054645, 0.11543715846994536, 0.06898907103825136, 0.04849726775956284, 0.03278688524590164], "mean_ttft_ms": 157.25219637533883, "median_ttft_ms": 154.56497500417754, "std_ttft_ms": 39.4092165158164, "p50_ttft_ms": 154.56497500417754, "p90_ttft_ms": 203.28902796609327, "p99_ttft_ms": 243.3665891934652, "mean_tpot_ms": 14.722655605570981, "median_tpot_ms": 15.590703338382792, "std_tpot_ms": 3.556924847795112, "p50_tpot_ms": 15.590703338382792, "p90_tpot_ms": 17.294968258889675, "p99_tpot_ms": 18.8637510351305, "mean_itl_ms": 40.429298360412176, "median_itl_ms": 38.692218484357, "std_itl_ms": 13.5326140425644, "p50_itl_ms": 38.692218484357, "p90_itl_ms": 41.082294669467956, "p99_itl_ms": 129.69392822589725, "mean_e2el_ms": 3856.532996353053, "median_e2el_ms": 2392.352676484734, "std_e2el_ms": 4007.938951307638, "p50_e2el_ms": 2392.352676484734, "p90_e2el_ms": 9091.298914980143, "p99_e2el_ms": 14257.287533005}